ch\nwhen an already-ready human view must match exactly; a loading epoch\nintentionally becomes stale as tiles or layout finish.\nAfter publication, the newly opened viewer can still be mounting. A single\n`a2ui_view_stale` or `a2ui_render_not_ready` result is not the end of the review:\ninspect the same immutable artifact again and retry capture with its current\nviewer. If `ready` is false, pass `expected_view_revision=null` rather than guessing\nzero. Retry at most twice for each requested view; stop and report the actual limitation if the viewer\nis absent or still cannot supply pixels. After each successful declared tab or\ncamera change, use the acknowledged epoch or inspect afresh before capture.\nIf capture or a requested control is unavailable, make supported structural\ncorrections and state the remaining verification limit; do not fabricate a\ncapture or describe a map camera as controllable because the person can zoom it.\n\nInspect at the size the person will use. Check the overview, relevant tabs,\nlabels, legends, units, contrast, clipping, framing and controls. Ask whether\nthe view answers the question and is valuable to a human: can the reader find\nthe important comparison without deciphering a dense wall of marks?\nAlso review the explanation: what conclusion can a person see in this image,\nwhich marks support it, and what uncertainty remains? Compare related panels'\ncategory meanings, ranges, dates and selected records. Use direct labels or\nreference marks where they reduce the effort of finding the evidence. Remove\nredundant panels and give the central comparison more space. Load the dashboard\nskill's `references/report-design.md` when composing a substantial report.\nCheck composition as a whole: can related charts, images, viewports and text\nbe interpreted together without tab switching? Review a whole-report image,\nnot only individual views. Preserve unequal row proportions when expanded\nand readable stacking when docked. Optional tabs must not hide essential\nevidence from the initial view or PNG.\nPerform this review yourself before presenting a complex visual; the person\nshould not need to request a screenshot check separately.\nWhen a view is crowded, show the meaningful subset or aggregate first. Retain\nthe complete source data and explain the initial slice. Make additional series,\nlayers or views available through catalog-supported selectors, filters, tabs\nor optional-view controls, with readable labels and visible inclusion state.\nDo not invent a visibility property or hide contrary evidence to improve the\nstory. Check the revealed detail as well as the quiet default.\n\nUse annotations to point to evidence during explanations and questions.\nUpdate a chart with supported layered marks for a labelled point, red outline,\nrange or trend; keep the original rows and quantitative encodings intact.\nUse real data coordinates or stable entity IDs when a mark should follow\nzoom/filter changes. A pixel-positioned mark belongs to one captured viewport;\ndo not reuse it on a different view as if it still identifies the same data.\nAnnotations clarify evidence; they do not change measurements or submit an\nanswer. `ask_user` continues to own question submission independently.\n\nFor worked decision patterns, load `references/investigation-patterns.md`\nfrom this skill. Stop once the question is resolved and the relevant views\nare readable; further captures should answer a remaining concern. Keep visual\nobservations, calculations and unresolved uncertainty distinct in the answer.\n\nKeep the final response focused on the requested deliverables and findings.\n`capture_a2ui_surface` retains its screenshots as verification evidence; do not\nregister or list each capture as another output. For other review images/PDFs,\nuse `create_artifact(..., purpose=\"verification\")`; working files use\n`purpose=\"intermediate\"`. Both remain accessible in Observability and lineage.\nRequested images/PDFs use `purpose=\"deliverable\"`. When revising an output,\nkeep its artifact family/name; the response presents its latest deliverable\nversion while Versions and Observability retain earlier attempts.\n\nBundled files (use file=... for one or files=[...] for a batch):\n- examples/annotated-scatter.json\n- references/investigation-patterns.md","label":"","language":"","workspace_id":"","path":"","sha256":"","pages":[],"uri":"","command":"","timed_out":false,"status":"","detail":"","items":[],"action_label":""}]},"duration_ms":113.95382881164551,"started_at":"2026-10-19T06:55:54.965076+00:00","completed_at":"2026-10-19T06:55:55.079030+00:00"},{"id":"call_87f1be5f2bd2","session_id":"sess_9cca40f4085e","run_id":"a359ea79-4c95-4063-89a8-f345ed58c687","name":"load_skill","title":"Load skill","state":"succeeded","input":{"kwargs":{"file":"","files":["catalog.json#/components/clio.map.v1","catalog.json#/components/Image","catalog.json#/components/Column"],"skill_id":"a2ui-catalog-clio-workspace"}},"output":"=== File 1/3: catalog.json#/components/clio.map.v1 ===\n{\n  \"allOf\": [\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/CatalogComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"dependentRequired\": {\n        \"dataQuery\": [\n          \"dataUri\"\n        ],\n        \"filterFields\": [\n          \"dataUri\"\n        ],\n        \"orderField\": [\n          \"trackField\"\n        ],\n        \"trackField\": [\n          \"dataUri\",\n          \"orderField\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"action\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/Action\"\n        },\n        \"actionLabel\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\"\n        },\n        \"camera\": {\n          \"description\": \"Camera literal or data-model binding. longitude/latitude/zoom are required; bearing and pitch default to zero. Bound cameras are shared and updated by human navigation. Use update_a2ui_data_model on the declared path to pan, zoom or rotate, then capture the resulting view.\",\n          \"oneOf\": [\n            {\n              \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/MapCamera\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DataBinding\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"categoryField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column grouping points into categories.\"\n        },\n        \"component\": {\n          \"const\": \"clio.map.v1\"\n        },\n        \"dataQuery\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/DataQuery\"\n        },\n        \"dataUri\": {\n          \"description\": \"A workspace file path or artifact:// reference; CLIO registers a path as an artifact before validation. Requires latitudeField/longitudeField/labelField; a referenced dataset is bounded by dataQuery/limit, not the inline point cap.\",\n          \"not\": {\n            \"pattern\": \"\\\\s\"\n          },\n          \"pattern\": \"^artifact://artifact_[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"detailField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding each point's detail text.\"\n        },\n        \"filterFields\": {\n          \"description\": \"With dataUri, columns worth filtering while exploring this map. Choose one or more real columns from the task and dataset, such as a category, magnitude, or time column. Use a registered table even for small maps when these native filters matter. The viewer creates typed controls and applies them to the map and Reference this; omit for the viewer's default fields.\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 12,\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        \"geojsonUri\": {\n          \"description\": \"Artifact URI of a GeoJSON FeatureCollection. Geometry is read by reference and drawn as points, lines, and polygons; feature properties supply labelField, categoryField, or valueField when named.\",\n          \"not\": {\n            \"pattern\": \"\\\\s\"\n          },\n          \"pattern\": \"^artifact://artifact_[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"idField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding each point's stable id.\"\n        },\n        \"labelField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding each point's label (required with dataUri).\"\n        },\n        \"latitudeField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding latitude (required with dataUri).\"\n        },\n        \"longitudeField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding longitude (required with dataUri).\"\n        },\n        \"orderField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"With trackField, time or numeric sequence column ordering positions along each trajectory.\"\n        },\n        \"points\": {\n          \"description\": \"Inline points (at most 500) \\u2014 this array rides the surface's own wire message, so it is capped for transfer size; for a larger dataset use dataUri instead, unbounded and paged/downsampled by the viewer.\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/MapPoint\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 500,\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        \"selected\": {\n          \"maxLength\": 128,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"selection\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicValue\",\n          \"description\": \"Bind to /selection/<key>; the bound value is a SelectionState ({field, values[], source?}, see $defs/SelectionState). Components bound to the same path share one selection.\"\n        },\n        \"selectionField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column the shared selection's values are drawn from; required when selection is bound.\"\n        },\n        \"title\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\"\n        },\n        \"trackField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"With dataUri, column identifying each trajectory (for example storm_id). Rows with the same value form one path.\"\n        },\n        \"valueField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Numeric dataset column used for a continuous colour scale and legend.\"\n        },\n        \"valueLabel\": {\n          \"description\": \"Human-readable name for the numeric map legend, such as Displacement.\",\n          \"maxLength\": 80,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"valueUnit\": {\n          \"description\": \"Unit shown beside a continuous-colour legend's values.\",\n          \"maxLength\": 40,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"component\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Exactly one of points, dataUri, or geojsonUri is required.\",\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"not\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"dataUri\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"geojsonUri\"\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"points\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"not\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"points\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"geojsonUri\"\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"dataUri\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"not\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"points\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"dataUri\"\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"geojsonUri\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"dataUri requires the point field names.\",\n      \"if\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"dataUri\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"latitudeField\",\n          \"longitudeField\",\n          \"labelField\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"not\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"categoryField\",\n          \"valueField\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"selectionField is required when selection is bound (an object, not a literal).\",\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"selection\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"selection\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"selectionField\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"Interactive points, ordered trajectories, or GeoJSON geometry on a map.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"unevaluatedProperties\": false\n}\n\nStandard refs (not loadable here): https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/Action, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DataBinding, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicValue\n\n=== File 2/3: catalog.json#/components/Image ===\n{\n  \"allOf\": [\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/CatalogComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"component\": {\n          \"const\": \"Image\"\n        },\n        \"description\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\"\n        },\n        \"fit\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"contain\",\n            \"cover\",\n            \"fill\",\n            \"none\",\n            \"scaleDown\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"url\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\"\n        },\n        \"variant\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"icon\",\n            \"avatar\",\n            \"smallFeature\",\n            \"mediumFeature\",\n            \"largeFeature\",\n            \"header\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"component\",\n        \"url\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"A raster or vector image by URL, sized to a preset variant.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"unevaluatedProperties\": false\n}\n\nStandard refs (not loadable here): https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\n\n=== File 3/3: catalog.json#/components/Column ===\n{\n  \"allOf\": [\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/CatalogComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"align\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"start\",\n            \"center\",\n            \"end\",\n            \"stretch\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"children\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ChildList\"\n        },\n        \"component\": {\n          \"const\": \"Column\"\n        },\n        \"justify\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"start\",\n            \"center\",\n            \"end\",\n            \"spaceBetween\",\n            \"spaceAround\",\n            \"spaceEvenly\",\n            \"stretch\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"component\",\n        \"children\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"A vertical layout container for child components.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"unevaluatedProperties\": false\n}\n\nStandard refs (not loadable here): https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ChildList, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon\n\n### Shared by catalog.json\n## Shared definitions (each referenced by name below, defined once for this call)\n\n### $defs/CatalogComponentCommon\n{\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"weight\": {\n      \"description\": \"Relative flex weight of this component inside a Row or Column. Only meaningful as a direct child of one.\",\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/DataQuery\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"description\": \"A server-side table query applied to dataUri: the table-query request body (POST /v1/artifacts/{id}/table-query) without format. The server runs filter, then aggregate, then downsample, then sort, then offset/limit. Omit columns to request every column of dataUri \\u2014 except alongside aggregate, where columns is required, since aggregate's output columns (e.g. price_mean) don't exist in the source and so cannot be inferred. limit bounds the rows in ONE response (a transfer size), not the underlying data; offset pages through a larger result across several requests. When a chart or map query would otherwise exceed limit without an explicit downsample, the server instead samples evenly across the full range and reports that it did, rather than silently truncating to the first rows. limit's own maximum here is a generous safety ceiling, not the deployment's real per-response cap, which is server-configured. A viewer (e.g. an interactive data-table) may layer its own user-driven paging/filtering/sorting on top of this dataQuery without replacing it \\u2014 the agent's own filter/aggregate/downsample intent still applies underneath. Shared verbatim by clio.chart.v1, clio.map.v1, and clio.data-table.v1.\",\n  \"if\": {\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"aggregate\": {\n        \"not\": {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"aggregate\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"aggregate\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/QueryAggregate\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"columns\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 64,\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"downsample\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/QueryDownsample\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"filter\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/QueryFilter\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 64,\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"limit\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"maximum\": 50000,\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"offset\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"minimum\": 0,\n          \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"sort\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/QuerySort\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 64,\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"then\": {\n    \"required\": [\n      \"columns\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/FieldName\n{\n  \"maxLength\": 128,\n  \"minLength\": 1,\n  \"type\": \"string\"\n}\n\n### $defs/MapCamera\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"bearing\": {\n      \"default\": 0,\n      \"maximum\": 180,\n      \"minimum\": -180,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"latitude\": {\n      \"maximum\": 85,\n      \"minimum\": -85,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"longitude\": {\n      \"maximum\": 180,\n      \"minimum\": -180,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"pitch\": {\n      \"default\": 0,\n      \"maximum\": 60,\n      \"minimum\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"zoom\": {\n      \"maximum\": 16,\n      \"minimum\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"longitude\",\n    \"latitude\",\n    \"zoom\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/MapPoint\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"category\": {\n      \"description\": \"Nominal group, such as station type. Use value for measured numbers.\",\n      \"maxLength\": 120,\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"detail\": {\n      \"maxLength\": 2000,\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"id\": {\n      \"maxLength\": 128,\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"label\": {\n      \"maxLength\": 240,\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"latitude\": {\n      \"maximum\": 90,\n      \"minimum\": -90,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"longitude\": {\n      \"maximum\": 180,\n      \"minimum\": -180,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"value\": {\n      \"description\": \"Optional measured magnitude for a continuous colour scale and legend.\",\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"id\",\n    \"label\",\n    \"latitude\",\n    \"longitude\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/QueryAggregate\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"description\": \"Group rows by groupBy (empty or omitted: one global group) and reduce; each metric becomes a result column named {column}_{fn}, which must not repeat a groupBy column.\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"groupBy\": {\n      \"items\": {\n        \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n      },\n      \"maxItems\": 64,\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"uniqueItems\": true\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"items\": {\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"column\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n          },\n          \"fn\": {\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"mean\",\n              \"min\",\n              \"max\",\n              \"count\",\n              \"sum\",\n              \"median\"\n            ],\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"column\",\n          \"fn\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      },\n      \"maxItems\": 64,\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"uniqueItems\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"metrics\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/QueryDownsample\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"description\": \"How the server thins rows before limit applies. none keeps every row; stride keeps evenly spaced rows (per entityColumn up to maxPerEntity when set, else overall up to limit); per_entity_lttb runs LTTB on (x, y) per entityColumn (the whole table is one series without it) and needs x and y.\",\n  \"if\": {\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"mode\": {\n        \"const\": \"per_entity_lttb\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"mode\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"entityColumn\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"maxPerEntity\": {\n      \"default\": 500,\n      \"maximum\": 2000,\n      \"minimum\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"mode\": {\n      \"default\": \"none\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"none\",\n        \"stride\",\n        \"per_entity_lttb\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"x\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"y\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"then\": {\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"x\": {\n        \"not\": {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"y\": {\n        \"not\": {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"x\",\n      \"y\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/QueryFilter\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"allOf\": [\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"eq\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"type\": [\n                  \"string\",\n                  \"number\",\n                  \"boolean\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"value\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"in\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": [\n                    \"string\",\n                    \"number\",\n                    \"boolean\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"maxItems\": 10000,\n                \"minItems\": 1,\n                \"type\": \"array\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"value\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"range\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": [\n                    \"string\",\n                    \"number\",\n                    \"boolean\",\n                    \"null\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"maxItems\": 2,\n                \"minItems\": 2,\n                \"type\": \"array\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"value\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"isnull\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"type\": [\n                  \"boolean\",\n                  \"null\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"contains\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"minLength\": 1,\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"value\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"One predicate; all filter entries are AND-ed. eq: value is a non-null scalar. in: value is a non-empty list of scalars. range: value is [min, max], inclusive, either side may be null. isnull: value omitted or true matches nulls, false matches non-nulls. contains: value is a non-empty string, matched as a case-insensitive substring of a string column (a per-column text filter).\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"column\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n    },\n    \"op\": {\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"eq\",\n        \"in\",\n        \"range\",\n        \"isnull\",\n        \"contains\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"value\": {}\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"column\",\n    \"op\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/QuerySort\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"description\": \"One dataQuery.sort key; earlier entries in the list sort first.\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"column\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n    },\n    \"desc\": {\n      \"default\": false,\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"column\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}","presentation":{"subject":"skill-name","summary":"","blocks":[{"id":"skill-name","type":"text","media_type":"","text":"a2ui-catalog-clio-workspace","label":"","language":"","workspace_id":"","path":"","sha256":"","pages":[],"uri":"","command":"","timed_out":false,"status":"","detail":"","items":[],"action_label":""},{"id":"content","type":"markdown","media_type":"","text":"=== File 1/3: catalog.json#/components/clio.map.v1 ===\n{\n  \"allOf\": [\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/CatalogComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"dependentRequired\": {\n        \"dataQuery\": [\n          \"dataUri\"\n        ],\n        \"filterFields\": [\n          \"dataUri\"\n        ],\n        \"orderField\": [\n          \"trackField\"\n        ],\n        \"trackField\": [\n          \"dataUri\",\n          \"orderField\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"action\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/Action\"\n        },\n        \"actionLabel\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\"\n        },\n        \"camera\": {\n          \"description\": \"Camera literal or data-model binding. longitude/latitude/zoom are required; bearing and pitch default to zero. Bound cameras are shared and updated by human navigation. Use update_a2ui_data_model on the declared path to pan, zoom or rotate, then capture the resulting view.\",\n          \"oneOf\": [\n            {\n              \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/MapCamera\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DataBinding\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"categoryField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column grouping points into categories.\"\n        },\n        \"component\": {\n          \"const\": \"clio.map.v1\"\n        },\n        \"dataQuery\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/DataQuery\"\n        },\n        \"dataUri\": {\n          \"description\": \"A workspace file path or artifact:// reference; CLIO registers a path as an artifact before validation. Requires latitudeField/longitudeField/labelField; a referenced dataset is bounded by dataQuery/limit, not the inline point cap.\",\n          \"not\": {\n            \"pattern\": \"\\\\s\"\n          },\n          \"pattern\": \"^artifact://artifact_[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"detailField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding each point's detail text.\"\n        },\n        \"filterFields\": {\n          \"description\": \"With dataUri, columns worth filtering while exploring this map. Choose one or more real columns from the task and dataset, such as a category, magnitude, or time column. Use a registered table even for small maps when these native filters matter. The viewer creates typed controls and applies them to the map and Reference this; omit for the viewer's default fields.\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 12,\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        \"geojsonUri\": {\n          \"description\": \"Artifact URI of a GeoJSON FeatureCollection. Geometry is read by reference and drawn as points, lines, and polygons; feature properties supply labelField, categoryField, or valueField when named.\",\n          \"not\": {\n            \"pattern\": \"\\\\s\"\n          },\n          \"pattern\": \"^artifact://artifact_[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"idField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding each point's stable id.\"\n        },\n        \"labelField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding each point's label (required with dataUri).\"\n        },\n        \"latitudeField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding latitude (required with dataUri).\"\n        },\n        \"longitudeField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column holding longitude (required with dataUri).\"\n        },\n        \"orderField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"With trackField, time or numeric sequence column ordering positions along each trajectory.\"\n        },\n        \"points\": {\n          \"description\": \"Inline points (at most 500) \\u2014 this array rides the surface's own wire message, so it is capped for transfer size; for a larger dataset use dataUri instead, unbounded and paged/downsampled by the viewer.\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/MapPoint\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 500,\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        \"selected\": {\n          \"maxLength\": 128,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"selection\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicValue\",\n          \"description\": \"Bind to /selection/<key>; the bound value is a SelectionState ({field, values[], source?}, see $defs/SelectionState). Components bound to the same path share one selection.\"\n        },\n        \"selectionField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Dataset column the shared selection's values are drawn from; required when selection is bound.\"\n        },\n        \"title\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\"\n        },\n        \"trackField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"With dataUri, column identifying each trajectory (for example storm_id). Rows with the same value form one path.\"\n        },\n        \"valueField\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\",\n          \"description\": \"Numeric dataset column used for a continuous colour scale and legend.\"\n        },\n        \"valueLabel\": {\n          \"description\": \"Human-readable name for the numeric map legend, such as Displacement.\",\n          \"maxLength\": 80,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"valueUnit\": {\n          \"description\": \"Unit shown beside a continuous-colour legend's values.\",\n          \"maxLength\": 40,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"component\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Exactly one of points, dataUri, or geojsonUri is required.\",\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"not\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"dataUri\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"geojsonUri\"\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"points\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"not\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"points\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"geojsonUri\"\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"dataUri\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"not\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"points\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"dataUri\"\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"geojsonUri\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"dataUri requires the point field names.\",\n      \"if\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"dataUri\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"latitudeField\",\n          \"longitudeField\",\n          \"labelField\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"not\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"categoryField\",\n          \"valueField\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"selectionField is required when selection is bound (an object, not a literal).\",\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"selection\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"selection\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"selectionField\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"Interactive points, ordered trajectories, or GeoJSON geometry on a map.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"unevaluatedProperties\": false\n}\n\nStandard refs (not loadable here): https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/Action, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DataBinding, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicValue\n\n=== File 2/3: catalog.json#/components/Image ===\n{\n  \"allOf\": [\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/CatalogComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"component\": {\n          \"const\": \"Image\"\n        },\n        \"description\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\"\n        },\n        \"fit\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"contain\",\n            \"cover\",\n            \"fill\",\n            \"none\",\n            \"scaleDown\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"url\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\"\n        },\n        \"variant\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"icon\",\n            \"avatar\",\n            \"smallFeature\",\n            \"mediumFeature\",\n            \"largeFeature\",\n            \"header\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"component\",\n        \"url\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"A raster or vector image by URL, sized to a preset variant.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"unevaluatedProperties\": false\n}\n\nStandard refs (not loadable here): https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/DynamicString\n\n=== File 3/3: catalog.json#/components/Column ===\n{\n  \"allOf\": [\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/CatalogComponentCommon\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"align\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"start\",\n            \"center\",\n            \"end\",\n            \"stretch\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"children\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ChildList\"\n        },\n        \"component\": {\n          \"const\": \"Column\"\n        },\n        \"justify\": {\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"start\",\n            \"center\",\n            \"end\",\n            \"spaceBetween\",\n            \"spaceAround\",\n            \"spaceEvenly\",\n            \"stretch\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"component\",\n        \"children\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"A vertical layout container for child components.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"unevaluatedProperties\": false\n}\n\nStandard refs (not loadable here): https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ChildList, https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/common_types.json#/$defs/ComponentCommon\n\n### Shared by catalog.json\n## Shared definitions (each referenced by name below, defined once for this call)\n\n### $defs/CatalogComponentCommon\n{\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"weight\": {\n      \"description\": \"Relative flex weight of this component inside a Row or Column. Only meaningful as a direct child of one.\",\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/DataQuery\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"description\": \"A server-side table query applied to dataUri: the table-query request body (POST /v1/artifacts/{id}/table-query) without format. The server runs filter, then aggregate, then downsample, then sort, then offset/limit. Omit columns to request every column of dataUri \\u2014 except alongside aggregate, where columns is required, since aggregate's output columns (e.g. price_mean) don't exist in the source and so cannot be inferred. limit bounds the rows in ONE response (a transfer size), not the underlying data; offset pages through a larger result across several requests. When a chart or map query would otherwise exceed limit without an explicit downsample, the server instead samples evenly across the full range and reports that it did, rather than silently truncating to the first rows. limit's own maximum here is a generous safety ceiling, not the deployment's real per-response cap, which is server-configured. A viewer (e.g. an interactive data-table) may layer its own user-driven paging/filtering/sorting on top of this dataQuery without replacing it \\u2014 the agent's own filter/aggregate/downsample intent still applies underneath. Shared verbatim by clio.chart.v1, clio.map.v1, and clio.data-table.v1.\",\n  \"if\": {\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"aggregate\": {\n        \"not\": {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"aggregate\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"aggregate\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/QueryAggregate\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"columns\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 64,\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"uniqueItems\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"downsample\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/QueryDownsample\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"filter\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/QueryFilter\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 64,\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"limit\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"maximum\": 50000,\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"offset\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"minimum\": 0,\n          \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"sort\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"items\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/QuerySort\"\n          },\n          \"maxItems\": 64,\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"then\": {\n    \"required\": [\n      \"columns\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/FieldName\n{\n  \"maxLength\": 128,\n  \"minLength\": 1,\n  \"type\": \"string\"\n}\n\n### $defs/MapCamera\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"bearing\": {\n      \"default\": 0,\n      \"maximum\": 180,\n      \"minimum\": -180,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"latitude\": {\n      \"maximum\": 85,\n      \"minimum\": -85,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"longitude\": {\n      \"maximum\": 180,\n      \"minimum\": -180,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"pitch\": {\n      \"default\": 0,\n      \"maximum\": 60,\n      \"minimum\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"zoom\": {\n      \"maximum\": 16,\n      \"minimum\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"longitude\",\n    \"latitude\",\n    \"zoom\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/MapPoint\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"category\": {\n      \"description\": \"Nominal group, such as station type. Use value for measured numbers.\",\n      \"maxLength\": 120,\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"detail\": {\n      \"maxLength\": 2000,\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"id\": {\n      \"maxLength\": 128,\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"label\": {\n      \"maxLength\": 240,\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"latitude\": {\n      \"maximum\": 90,\n      \"minimum\": -90,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"longitude\": {\n      \"maximum\": 180,\n      \"minimum\": -180,\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"value\": {\n      \"description\": \"Optional measured magnitude for a continuous colour scale and legend.\",\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"id\",\n    \"label\",\n    \"latitude\",\n    \"longitude\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/QueryAggregate\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"description\": \"Group rows by groupBy (empty or omitted: one global group) and reduce; each metric becomes a result column named {column}_{fn}, which must not repeat a groupBy column.\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"groupBy\": {\n      \"items\": {\n        \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n      },\n      \"maxItems\": 64,\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"uniqueItems\": true\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"items\": {\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"column\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n          },\n          \"fn\": {\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"mean\",\n              \"min\",\n              \"max\",\n              \"count\",\n              \"sum\",\n              \"median\"\n            ],\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"column\",\n          \"fn\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      },\n      \"maxItems\": 64,\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"uniqueItems\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"metrics\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/QueryDownsample\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"description\": \"How the server thins rows before limit applies. none keeps every row; stride keeps evenly spaced rows (per entityColumn up to maxPerEntity when set, else overall up to limit); per_entity_lttb runs LTTB on (x, y) per entityColumn (the whole table is one series without it) and needs x and y.\",\n  \"if\": {\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"mode\": {\n        \"const\": \"per_entity_lttb\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"mode\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"entityColumn\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"maxPerEntity\": {\n      \"default\": 500,\n      \"maximum\": 2000,\n      \"minimum\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"mode\": {\n      \"default\": \"none\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"none\",\n        \"stride\",\n        \"per_entity_lttb\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"x\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"y\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/FieldName\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"then\": {\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"x\": {\n        \"not\": {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"y\": {\n        \"not\": {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"x\",\n      \"y\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"type\": \"object\"\n}\n\n### $defs/QueryFilter\n{\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"allOf\": [\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"eq\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"type\": [\n                  \"string\",\n                  \"number\",\n                  \"boolean\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"value\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"in\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": [\n                    \"string\",\n                    \"number\",\n                    \"boolean\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"maxItems\": 10000,\n                \"minItems\": 1,\n                \"type\": \"array\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"value\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"range\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": [\n                    \"string\",\n                    \"number\",\n                    \"boolean\",\n                    \"null\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"maxItems\": 2,\n                \"minItems\": 2,\n                \"type\": \"array\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"value\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"isnull\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"type\": [\n                  \"boolean\",\n                  \"null\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"if\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"op\": {\n            \"const\": \"contains\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"then\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"value\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"minLength\": 1,\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"path\": {\n                    \"pattern\": \"^/\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"path\"\n                ],\n                \"type\": \"object\"\n              }\n            ]\